  "details": "I have one-handed movement set in the action menu\n\nI observed the behaviour with the personal mirror (immersive move disabled), however, I've confirmed that regular pickups are also impacted\n\nBug can be reproduced in two ways\n\nHave Personal mirror (or other pickup)\n\nOpen Action menu\n\nTry to pickup/move the object using the same hand\n\nIn open beta, you are unable to\n\nIn live, this works correctly\n\nOr\n\nHave Personal mirror\n\nPickup personal mirror\n\nOpen Action menu\n\nTry to drop the object using the same hand\n\nIn open beta, you are unable to\n\nIn live, this works correctly",
